<title>ITALY: Reno De Medici H1 96 net profit up 50 pct.</title>
<headline>Reno De Medici H1 96 net profit up 50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian cardboard maker Reno De Medici said it posted first half 1996 pre-tax net profit of 12.4 billion lire against 8.2 billion in the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>The company, listed on the Milan bourse in July, said gross operating profit rose to 27.8 billion lire from 22.5 billion on revenues slightly down at 133.8 billion lire against 152.5 billion.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it expected a significant recovery in the second half this year due to improved sales.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
